= @PRODUCT@ by Windward Audio
~ Read Me, version @VERSION@

== What it is
@DESCRIPTION@

@EACH_PLUGIN@- @NAME@: @KIND_ARTICLE@ @KIND@, as an Audio Unit (AU) and a VST3 plug-in.
@END@

Everything is installed by @PRODUCT@ Installer.pkg, with the sounds and factory presets, for all users of this Mac.

== System requirements
- macOS @MIN_MACOS@ (@MIN_MACOS_NAME@) or later
- Apple Silicon or Intel Mac
- @DISK_SPACE@ of disk space
- A music app that loads Audio Unit or VST3 plug-ins (GarageBand, Logic Pro, Ableton Live, Cubase, Reaper, Studio One, ...)

== Install
1. Quit GarageBand, Logic Pro and any other music apps.
2. Double-click @PRODUCT@ Installer.pkg and follow the steps. To leave out the AU or the VST3 version, click Customize on the Installation Type page.
3. Open your music app and find @PRODUCT@ under Windward Audio.

== Where to find it
:: GarageBand
@EACH_PLUGIN@- @NAME@: @GARAGEBAND_PATH@.
@END@
- If you see sliders instead of the plug-in's window, switch the plug-in window's view menu from "Controls" to "Editor".
:: Logic Pro
@EACH_PLUGIN@- @NAME@: @LOGIC_PATH@.
@END@
- If it is missing, open Settings > Plug-in Manager, select it under Windward Audio and click "Reset & Rescan Selection".
:: Other music apps
Rescan plug-ins if your app asks, then look for Windward Audio (or the plug-in's name) in the instrument or effect list, as AU or VST3.

== Presets
The factory presets are built into the plug-ins. Presets you save are kept in:
@EACH_PLUGIN@    ~/Library/Windward Audio/@NAME@/Presets
@END@
> ~ is your home folder. In Finder, choose Go > Go to Folder and paste the path.

== Updates
When a new version of @PRODUCT@ is available, download it and run its installer. It replaces the installed version; your own presets are kept.

== Uninstall
Quit your music apps, then move these to the Trash (Finder will ask for your password):
@EACH_PLUGIN@    /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/@NAME@.component
    /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/@NAME@.vst3
@END@
To remove your saved presets as well, also move these to the Trash:
@EACH_PLUGIN@    ~/Library/Windward Audio/@NAME@
@END@

